      "name": "Blood-Draining Gaze",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "occult",
        "visual"
      ],
      "text": "20 feet. When a living, non-scarlet walker creature ends its turn in the aura, it must attempt a DC 29 Fortitude save save to prevent thin streams of blood from streaming from its eyes and into the eyeless pits in the scarlet walker's face. On a failed save, the victim becomes Drained 1 (Drained 2 on a critical failure) and Sickened 1 from the pain.",
      "rules": [
